# Inspection UI

- UI copy is English. The visual theme is dark with blue accents.
- Read categories, models, and experiment protocols from the API. Do not duplicate catalog ids or hyperparameter defaults in components.
- Anomaly scores are scores. Do not label them as physical severity or financial loss.
- Show API errors in the page that triggered the request. Do not keep a stale map after a failed call.
- Inference actions run when the user submits the form, not when a control changes.
- Dataset views must surface the MVTec non-commercial license.
